{"id":32600,"slug":"okja","title":"Okja","year":2017,"country":"South Korea, United States","duration":121,"spine":1133,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/32600-okja","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/2f47de972bef410a28f8f3a502c411cc/KQLIwXLCjICP8xrwEipjRZ5er5eZo0_large.jpg","description":"Master genre exploder Bong Joon Ho swirls pathos, dark satire, action, and horror into an exhilarating twenty-first-century fairy tale. An all-star cast including Tilda Swinton, Paul Dano, Steven Yeun, and Jake Gyllenhaal is led by An Seo Hyun as Mija, a South Korean girl growing up on an Edenic mountainside with her grandfather and best friend: Okja, a giant, empathetic “superpig” created as part of a secret GMO experiment. When Okja is abruptly torn away from her, Mija embarks on a perilous rescue mission that places her at the center of a sinister corporate conspiracy. While Bong’s trademark virtuosic set pieces dazzle, Okja’s beating heart is the connection between a girl and her superpig, made all the more poignant by the brilliant special effects that bring its animal star to unforgettable life.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Bong Joon Ho","slug":"bong-joon-ho"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Tilda Swinton","role":"Lucy Mirando/Nancy Mirando","slug":"tilda-swinton"},{"actor":"Paul Dano","role":"Jay","slug":"paul-dano"},{"actor":"An Seo Hyun","role":"Mija","slug":"an-seo-hyun"},{"actor":"Byun Hee Bong","role":"Hee Bong","slug":"byun-hee-bong"},{"actor":"Steven Yeun","role":"K","slug":"steven-yeun"},{"actor":"Lily Collins","role":"Red","slug":"lily-collins"},{"actor":"Yoon Je Moon","role":"Mundo Park","slug":"yoon-je-moon"},{"actor":"Shirley Henderson","role":"Jennifer","slug":"shirley-henderson"},{"actor":"Daniel Henshall","role":"Blond","slug":"daniel-henshall"},{"actor":"Devon Bostick","role":"Silver","slug":"devon-bostick"},{"actor":"Choi Woo Shik","role":"Kim","slug":"choi-woo-shik"},{"actor":"Giancarlo Esposito","role":"Frank Dawson","sl